{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "cateye.napcat-shadow-adapter",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "name": "NapCat 影子适配器",
  "description": "影子中继：监控 NapCat 适配器易被去重误丢的四类通知（表情回应/群撤回/好友撤回/精华消息），通过独立 OneBot WebSocket 连接协议端，对适配器未成功入站的事件以 is_notify 合成通知补投；适配器已送达的事件自动跳过。自动镜像适配器黑白名单与全局屏蔽用户；可选按目标消息 @ 官方机器人/@ 全局屏蔽用户过滤补投（默认关闭）。不改写、不拦截，上游修复后自动失效。合并版适配器（SnowLuma Adapter 1.0.x，随 MaiBot 1.3.0 发布）已修复通知去重缺陷（Napcat-Adapter issue #97），本插件使命完成：自 0.3.1 起 manifest 仅支持宿主 1.2.x，在 MaiBot 1.3.0 上注册失败属预期行为，请直接停用卸载。",
  "author": {
    "name": "cateye",
    "url": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_napcat_shadow_adapter",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_napcat_shadow_adapter",
    "documentation": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_napcat_shadow_adapter/blob/main/README.md",
    "issues": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_napcat_shadow_adapter/issues"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.0.0",
    "max_version": "1.2.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.3.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "type": "python_package",
      "name": "websockets",
      "version_spec": ">=10.0"
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": ["config.get_plugin"],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN"
  },
  "plugin_type": "adapter",
  "display": {
    "icon": {
      "type": "lucide",
      "value": "ghost"
    }
  },
  "changelog": "CHANGELOG.md"
}
